      "protocol_version_id": "PV-PX104-1.0",
      "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
      "source_quote": "The patient must have a confirmed diagnosis of SYN-CONDITION-A at screening. Accept a verified\ncondition code or a synthetic adjudicated note establishing that diagnosis. An ambiguous or unconfirmed\nlabel does not establish the diagnosis and yields UNKNOWN. This criterion defines no disease-severity,\nsymptom-duration or genotype restriction.\n",
