      "evidence_requirement": "New synthetic numeric eGFR below the fictional threshold during participation, with valid units and specimen/effective time.",
      "logical_group_id": "PX104-MONITORING-INDEPENDENT",
      "protocol_version_id": "PV-PX104-1.0",
      "missing_data_policy": "UNKNOWN_UNLESS_RECONCILED",
      "source_quote": "During human-recorded participation, a new synthetic eGFR result below 60 mL/min/1.73m² requires clinical\nreview. Use the clinical specimen/effective time, valid units and provenance. The result opens a\nrule-specific monitoring finding for human assessment; it is not a diagnosis, toxicity determination or\nautonomous withdrawal instruction. This rule adds no scheduled testing requirement or new screening\ncriterion.\n",
